Gatoryap is licensed per-component. There is no single license covering this
repository — check the directory a file lives in before reusing it.

    server/     GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later)
                See server/LICENSE

    core/       Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
                See core/LICENSE

    app/        Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
                See app/LICENSE

Every source file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier header naming its license.
That header is authoritative for the file it appears in.

WHY THE SPLIT

The server is AGPL: running a modified copy as a network service obliges you to
publish those modifications. The core and app modules are Apache-2.0 because they
are linked into binaries distributed through app stores, whose terms are
incompatible with GPL-family licenses.

This boundary is load-bearing. AGPL-licensed code must never be linked into
core/ or app/. Clients communicate with the server over HTTP only.

TRADEMARK

"Gatoryap", the Gatoryap logo, and related marks are not licensed under either
license above. Forks must adopt a different name and branding.

